<title>FINLAND: NORDIC SKIING-WORLD CUP COMBINED LEADING RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NORDIC SKIING-WORLD CUP COMBINED LEADING RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROVANIEMI, Finland 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results in a</p>
<p>Nordic combined World Cup event after the cross-country skiing</p>
<p>on Sunday:</p>
<p> 1. Jari Mantila (Finland)	 234.0 points in ski</p>
<p>jumping/44 minutes 33.6 seconds in 15-km cross country</p>
<p> 2. Samppa Lajunen (Finland)     219.5/43:30.6</p>
<p> 3. Mario Stecher (Austria)	224.5/44:13.6</p>
<p> 4. Tim Tetreault (U.S.)	   224.0/44:21.1</p>
<p> 5. Knut Tore Apeland (Norway)   202.5/42:41.1</p>
<p> 6. Kenji Ogiwara (Japan)	  212.5/43:44.3</p>
<p> 7. Christoph Eugen (Austria)    202.5/42:46.1</p>
<p> 8. Kristian Hammer (Norway)     210.0/43:32.4</p>
<p> 9. Fred B. Lundberg (Norway)    215.5/44:09.6</p>
<p>10. Sylvain Guillaume (France)  212.0/43:49.5</p>
